    <briefdescription>
<para>Attached (forked) execution strategy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Launches in a separate JVM process with inherited I/O (stdout/stderr go to parent process). Works for both compile and run tasks. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
